[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16442.99, "timestamp": "04:34:02", "text": "从早到晚，夜里也有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16449.189, "timestamp": "04:34:09", "text": "有点，然后就像12到是的，所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16452.75, "timestamp": "04:34:12", "text": "晚上睡了12个小时，醒来后就醒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16460.109, "timestamp": "04:34:20", "text": "530 哇，我聊了很多，所以我走上前去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16469.47, "timestamp": "04:34:29", "text": "4:30 步行上楼，泡了茶，吃了点东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16473.269, "timestamp": "04:34:33", "text": "香蕉和一些零食"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16476.51, "timestamp": "04:34:36", "text": "零食，还有，我最近熬夜比较多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16478.47, "timestamp": "04:34:38", "text": "医学方面，你的健康状况还好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16481.189, "timestamp": "04:34:41", "text": "它是以健康为基础的医学，比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16486.109, "timestamp": "04:34:46", "text": "比如，嗯，该怎么称呼它呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16488.029, "timestamp": "04:34:48", "text": "嗯，它叫什么来着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16491.109, "timestamp": "04:34:51", "text": "吃药就像我不是因为我不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16494.59, "timestamp": "04:34:54", "text": "睡眠和照顾好自己"}]